          "name": "Drilldown",
          "request": {
            "name": "Drilldown",
            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint retrieves any values in the cube that make up the overall value at the provided\ncross section of dimensions. For instance, in the example JSON \"Q1-19\" was provided as the \"Time\" dimension and\nyou can see that it returned a value for \"Jan-19\", \"Feb-19\", and \"Mar-19\" which all make up \"Q1-19\".\n\nDrilling down into a cube value is very similar to viewing details for a value, and filtering in that you are able\nto pass either the names of the dimensions or their IDs as parameters. A dimension value must be provided for each top\nlevel dimension.\n\nThe drilldown endpoint supports other currencies as long as the company has the alternate currency enabled.\n        ",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "cube",
                "drilldown"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
